Package: coloristr
Type: Package
Title: Convenient Colors and Themes for 'ggplot2'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Lei", "Guo", email = "leiguo0812@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides convenient color palettes, scales, and theme helpers
    for 'ggplot2'. Most bundled palettes are derived from the 'tidyplots'
    package, with additional palettes collected from published sources.
